T1  - Misinformation in Social Media Narratives on Highly Pathogenic Avian Influenza: Systematic Content Analysis of Facebook and Instagram Posts
AU  - Al-Rawi, Ahmed
AU  - Ackah, Betty
AU  - Fakida, Abdelrahman
AU  - Lee, Kelley
JO  - Journal of Medical Internet Research
VL  - 28
